{
 "encounter_id": "00735",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "NURSE"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Good morning, Mrs Vega. I'm Hayley, I'll do your observations while you wait for the doctor. Arm out, please. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Of course. I'm a little anxious, I can't quite remember when I had the endoscopy. Was it September? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Blood pressure 124 over 76, pulse 70, temperature 36.7, oxygen 98 percent.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good morning, Mrs Vega. Thank you for coming back. You had your gastroscopy, the camera test of your stomach, on the second of October."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Was it? I'd have said September. Yes, I thought it was earlier."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It was October, I have the report. Before we go through it, how have you been? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Still the burning in my upper stomach, after meals, especially at night. I'm using more pillows."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And when did that start, roughly?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh, a year ago? Maybe longer. I couldn't tell you the month."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's fine. Any vomiting, trouble swallowing, or black stools?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No vomiting, no trouble swallowing. Nothing black."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you have any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, none."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your background?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Acid reflux, for years, and I had my appendix out, in 1998."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you smoke or drink?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I don't smoke. A glass of wine, now and then."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, shall I put her on the couch for you? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your tummy is soft, a little tender at the top, in the middle, and no masses."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that normal? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right, the results. The camera showed some redness and inflammation at the bottom of the gullet, and the lining looked a bit swollen in the stomach. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it cancer? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "No. The biopsies we took showed inflammation but no cancer cells. This fits with acid reflux, and I'd call it reflux oesophagitis."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Reflux oesophagitis. Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's very treatable, and not dangerous, but it needs proper management. I'd like to arrange a test for a stomach bacterium called Helicobacter, with a breath test."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A breath test? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "You breathe into a bag after a drink. Painless. And a blood test to check you aren't anaemic."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I can book the breath test, doctor, I'll give her instructions about stopping her tablets before it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you, Hayley. Mrs Vega, raise the head of the bed by a few inches, eat dinner at least three hours before sleep, and cut out large, fatty meals."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. I do love my midnight cheese. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The cheese will have to be earlier. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh dear. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you in six weeks to review how you are, and the test results."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Six weeks. Thank you very much, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
